WEBVTT

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.320
Shop owner.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.610
Could you shoot me a beam?

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.870
You got it!

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.030
Beams are so... unisex.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.080
It's starting.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.240
Here I go!

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.500
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.990
Super Spin!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:20.360
Marble Phantasm!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.630
I'm in big trouble again!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:38.260
The demon Akiha, in a fit of jealousy,
suddenly began selling pots and cosmetics!

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:38.960
It's so scary...

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.590
Stop! Don't lure him any further!

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.100
And the unexpected ally who appeared then...

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.680
Ren, what's that Konnyaku for?!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.470
Next, on White Moon Princess Phantasmoon:

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.440
Administrative Reform!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:57.220
I'll Marble Phantasm your heart next time, too!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.870
Magical girls, huh?

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.670
The girlhood period of humans is but a fleeting moment...

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:23.430
Wh...

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.810
Where am I?!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.000
Shiki!

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.560
Let's play!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.200
Tohno-kun, this is instant food!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.520
And the inside's still cold!

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:38.840
Yes.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:42.660
Indeed, recreation's important for resting your brain.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.780
Understood.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.790
I-I'm at the beach with Onii-chan...

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.160
Shiki-san, would you like some barley tea?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:55.580
Shiki-sama, you'll be sunburnt if you don't do anything about it.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.610
Well, hehe...

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:58.670
How do I say this...

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.320
What a sight for sore eyes.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.360
Nii-san!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:06.000
Geez! I know we're here to play, but you're still the eldest son of the Tohno family!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.640
Get a better grip on yourself!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.890
You haven't stopped grinning since we got here!

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.190
I-It's not like I'm thinking of anything strange.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.510
Really?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.830
Shiki!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:18.360
Aren't you glad we came?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.560
Yeah.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.700
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.390
Let go, you failure of a vampire!

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:24.740
Why should I?!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.780
It hurts, so stop it...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.050
The summer special plan!

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:32.660
The "Badump! Beach Volleyball Competition" hosted by the Tohno family!

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:35.560
W-Why the sudden...

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.290
You shouldn't be asking why, Shiki-san!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.920
It's the summer! The summer!

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.610
Even maids don't need to be maids at this time!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:45.260
It's the season where even I emerge as a woman from my maid garment cocoon.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:48.220
It's precisely because our souls are restless and blemished

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.270
that we should use sports to enhance our friendship!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.520
Yup yup.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:57.200
I basically just need to land the ball in my opponents' court, right?

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:59.360
You don't know about beach volleyball?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.290
You shout "Potemkin" during a serve

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.040
and "Gal Undo" when someone scores.

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:03.860
I see.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:04.530
Everyone knows that.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.380
Don't tell her lies.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:07.890
You...

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:13.370
Oh well, we're just having fun, so no need to worry about the little rules.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.870
Please split into two teams by drawing lots.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.370
The winning team will get a team prize.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.250
There are also various individual prizes!

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:25.370
What's more, the MVP this time gets...

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:29.280
the right to spend a night alone with Shiki-san in a private room!

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.780
Wait, Kohaku! That's morally-

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:40.000
Due to some mishaps, I was only able to
secure one large room and one private room!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:40.980
She did it on purpose.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.050
Redo the preparations immediately, or it'll be too late!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.150
Don't worry.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.220
You're fantastic at sports, Akiha-sama,

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:53.690
so all you need to do to protect Shiki-sama from danger is become the MVP!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.560
Congrats on becoming the MVP.

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.440
Thank you, Nii-san.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.050
It's a little embarrassing to be alone together, though.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.170
Not at all. I'm very happy.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:08.550
Akiha.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.530
Nii-san...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.430
Y-You're right.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.740
I've got to do something about this.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.470
What's wrong?

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.100
N-N-Nothing at all!

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.070
Now then, let's decide the teams by drawing lots!

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:27.080
What? I'm with Ciel?

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.160
Not cool.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.260
I'm not exactly happy with this either.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.020
I-I'm with foreigners.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.620
Let's do our best, Miyako-chan.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.870
S-She stinks of curry! Is she Indian?!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:37.840
We'll win for sure.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.420
Rest assured. I will be made to work hard.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.790
We have the best members.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.520
According to my calculations, the chances of us losing are zero.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.460
Will we really be okay?

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.590
Okay! Let's begin!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.310
Don't even think that you can catch my serve!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.430
Potemkin.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.010
Nice, Hisui!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.100
Gal Undo.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.350
Here I go!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.270
Little sister spike!

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.620
Hup!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.240
I'm not done yet!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.600
You're doing this on purpose!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.790
You could tell?

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.070
Y-You...

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.090
Look, the ball's still in play.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.960
MVP!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.760
Perfect positioning!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.100
I'm taking this!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:40.350
Onii-sama!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:41.840
Me?

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:42.440
Shoot!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.350
Miyako-chan!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.860
No!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.320
Miyako.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.320
What is it that you see ahead of your fist?

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:51.280
Master!

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:57.830
Such bad luck.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.830
Why is it always me...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.890
Hey, Ciel. The ball's still in play.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.170
Damn it! I'll save it and show you!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.330
MVP! MVP! MVP!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:18.510
Master?!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:19.930
What is it, Master?!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:22.030
No!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.460
Oh no!

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.900
I instinctively...

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:36.280
Gal Undo!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:36.910
Shut up!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.840
That was all within my calculations.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:40.760
What calculations?

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:41.870
Well, whatever.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.370
We'll end this in one fell swoop!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:45.750
Understood!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.040
Like hell I'd let you!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.230
Why?!

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.760
That was all within my calculations.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:02.680
How?!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:05.350
Now for my trump card!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.350
Wait! What are you doing?!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.360
Hey! That's against the rules!

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.450
Like I care!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.780
Gal Undo!

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:25.820
And so, the bloody and gruesome battle between the non-humans continued.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:27.460
I'm not non-human!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:35.470
Uh... 525 points versus 526 points...

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.890
You're not bad at all for a human, little sister!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:44.480
A-And you? Aren't you at your limit?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.880
Nope.

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.920
Alright, let's continue, little sister!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.230
But of course!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:50.700
Potemkin.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.360
I wanted to play too...

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.550
Gal Undo!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:02.860
Human desire knows no bounds.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.630
Next section coming up.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.280
Man, yesterday was hell.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:14.300
I'm never going to the beach with them again.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.290
Excuse me, do you mind sharing your table with another customer?

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.530
Ah, no problem-

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.010
Excuse me.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.440
What happened?!

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.890
I couldn't... fix the rocket.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:27.730
Roc-

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.380
Okay, okay, okay!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.290
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:43.680
Okay! So like, the three of us barely get any screen time,

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:48.380
but I do think that we can do our best together in this fashion!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:50.840
Having less screen time is easier, so what's so bad about it?

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.270
N-New kid!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:55.720
Do you think you can survive in this
harsh industry with that kind of spirit?!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.590
Survive, huh?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.820
I'll whack you from the back if you're blanking out!

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.040
You've got guts.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.470
So why did we include her as a member?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.060
Don't worry. It's all within my calculations.

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:10.030
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:14.280
So, for today, we'd be happy if you could just remember our names-

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.260
What?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.980
I forgot to take my laundry in. Can I go home?

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.610
That was all within my calculations.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.480
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:28.320
B-But well, that's how the world is, right?

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.950
So everyone-

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.200
The DVDs I rented are overdue!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:32.790
Okay...?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:33.740
I'll get fined...

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:35.170
Who cares!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:36.920
That was all within my calculations.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.800
Afterschool! Alleyway Alliance.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:45.650
That was great. Great, I tell you!

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:48.050
We've totally captured the hearts of our audience!

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:49.510
All within my calculations.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:52.010
You've got your calculations wrong...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.080
This is the real thing.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:28.160
Next episode preview!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.410
Next Episode

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.520
Don't trust someone over 30!

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.460
Today's Tiger Dojo begins now!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.320
Wait, why am I...?!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:42.840
Well, you've been rendered this way because of all
your unnecessary movements in the previous episode.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.260
Wait a minute!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.920
Aren't you colored, though?!

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.720
That's not fair! Why?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.800
But I have no intermediate frames,
and my lip movement only uses two.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.160
Damned producers, how selfish of them...

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:57.230
You're the one who's selfish, instructor...

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.650
Be free!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.340
I won't be bound by anyone! I'll be free!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.980
Go ahead and stop me if you can!

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:06.740
N-Next episode!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:08.600
It's a Daydream Everywhere.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.780
Look forward to it!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.950
Aah, she got stopped.
